  "ruleText": "Bar 101.02 “Apprentice” means a person being instructed in a shop or school and registered in accordance with RSA 313-A:24.\n\nSource. #6046-a, eff 6-1-95, EXPIRED: 6-1-03\n\nNew. #7932, eff 8-3-03; ss by #10412-A, eff 9-19-13; renumbered by #13810 (formerly Bar 101.02); renumbered by #14459, eff 1-1-26 (formerly Bar 101.01)",
